  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{PCl}_5$ when fluorinated in a polar organic solvent, ionic isomers are formed.\n$\\left[\\mathrm{PCl}_4^{+}\\right]\\left[\\mathrm{PCl}_4 \\mathrm{~F}_2\\right]^{-}$(colorless crystals)\n$\\left[\\mathrm{PCl}_4^{+}\\right]\\left[\\mathrm{PF}_6\\right]^{-}$(white crystals)",
    "image": null
